WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the launch film. The same text is burned into the picture;
this track exists so the narration is available to a screen reader, and to
anyone who wants the words rather than the frames. Timings come from the
film's own composition, so they track a re-cut.

cap1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.110
A DCF you can argue with.

cap2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.850
Point it at a price. It solves for the growth that price requires.

cap3
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.670
Move anything, and the whole answer moves with it.

cap4
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:19.100
Sixteen checks run first. A check that can't run is never a pass.

cap5
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.860
The multiples disagree too. So we don't average them in.
